2026-11-28T12:11:17.9264229Z [36;1m# Defaults[0m
2026-11-28T12:11:17.9264597Z [36;1m#[0m
2026-11-28T12:11:17.9265033Z [36;1m# As noted above defaults are awkward to handle as GitHub Actions will inject those values as the input[0m
2026-11-28T12:11:17.9265852Z [36;1m# if the caller doesn't provide them, thus if the input matches the default we don't set it as we[0m
